  first
  | exact @GlobalTheory.RSNonvan.fourProd_eq_exp
  | exact GlobalTheory.RSNonvan.fourProd_eq_exp
  | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.RSNonvan.fourProd_eq_exp <;> assumption)
